{"id":"product-001","question":"听岚 S2 关闭主动降噪时单次能用多久？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_tinglan_s2.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"关闭主动降噪单次续航 10 小时（含盒总续航 40 小时）。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-002","question":"S2 开了主动降噪，带上充电盒一共能用多久？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_tinglan_s2.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"开启主动降噪含盒总续航 24 小时（单次 6 小时）。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-003","question":"S1 和 S2 单只耳机各多重？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_catalog.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_compare","reference":"听岚 S1 单只 4.2 克，听岚 S2 单只 4.8 克。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-004","question":"听岚 S1 有主动降噪吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_tinglan_s1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"没有。S1 只有通话环境降噪，无主动降噪；需要主动降噪可看听岚 S2。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-005","question":"S1 的 8 小时和 32 小时能加起来算吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_tinglan_s1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"不能相加。32 小时是含充电盒的总续航，已包含首次耳机电量。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"product-006","question":"栖光 L1 额定功率多少，要什么电源？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_qiguang_l1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"额定功率 6 瓦，输入要求 5 伏直流、2 安；包装不含供电适配器。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-007","question":"栖光 L1 没有电的时候还能亮吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_qiguang_l1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"不能。它没有内置电池，需要有线供电，断电后不会继续照明。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-008","question":"买栖光 L1 会送电源适配器吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_qiguang_l1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"不送。包装含灯体、底座、供电线及说明书，不含供电适配器。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-009","question":"栖光 L1 色温有哪几档？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_qiguang_l1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"3000、4000、5000 开尔文三档色温；亮度另有三档，色温与亮度不是同一个参数。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-010","question":"木澈 C1 多大容量？保温能保多久？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_muche_c1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"标称容量 450 毫升；保温测试为室温 20 摄氏度、初始水温 95 摄氏度，6 小时后不低于 55 摄氏度，属于封闭静置测试口径，实际效果会随使用条件变化。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"product-011","question":"木澈 C1 可以放洗碗机洗吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_muche_c1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_usage","reference":"不可以。清洗方式为温水手洗，不放入洗碗机。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-012","question":"木澈 C1 能放微波炉里加热吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_muche_c1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_usage","reference":"不能。杯体不适合加热、冷冻或放入微波设备。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-013","question":"听岚 S1 的充电盒防水吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_tinglan_s1.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"product_spec","reference":"充电盒不防水；耳机防泼溅，但不适合游泳、浸泡或热水冲洗。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"product-014","question":"木澈保温杯保修多久？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_warranty.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"warranty","reference":"杯体制造缺陷保障期为 6 个月，密封圈等正常磨损部件不作永久更换承诺。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"logistics-001","question":"现货订单付款后多久发货？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"logistics_delivery.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"logistics","reference":"现货订单支付成功后通常在 48 小时内安排发出；预售商品以商品页写明的发货日期为准。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"logistics-002","question":"发出之后一般几天能到？偏远地区呢？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"logistics_delivery.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"logistics","reference":"发货后普通地区预计 2–4 天送达，偏远可配送地区预计 4–7 天，为自然日估计，不是延误赔付承诺。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"logistics-003","question":"运费怎么算，满多少包邮？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"logistics_shipping.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"logistics","reference":"普通可配送地区单笔订单优惠后商品实付满 99 元免普通配送运费，未满 99 元收取 8 元；偏远地区可能另收附加运费，以结算页为准。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"logistics-004","question":"我用券以后实付只有 95 块，还免运费吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"logistics_shipping.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"logistics","reference":"不免。是否免运按优惠后的商品实付金额判断，实付不足 99 元仍按未达门槛收取 8 元普通运费。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"logistics-005","question":"物流多久没更新可以找客服？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"logistics_tracking.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"logistics","reference":"单号生成后超过 24 小时仍无揽收记录，或运输轨迹连续 48 小时没有更新，可联系在线客服协助核查。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"logistics-006","question":"物流显示签收了但我没收到怎么办？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"logistics_tracking.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"logistics","reference":"先确认家人、代收点或门卫是否代收，并检查站内通知；仍找不到的由客服对接承运方核实。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"logistics-007","question":"包裹外箱破了还少了配件，我该保留什么？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"logistics_tracking.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"logistics","reference":"拍摄包裹全貌、面单和破损部位，条件允许时保留连续开箱视频；核对是否分包并保存装箱清单，不要丢弃填充物和外箱。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"aftersales-001","question":"商品有质量问题多久内可以退货？运费谁出？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_returns.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"after_sales","reference":"签收之日起 7 天内商品存在质量问题可申请退货，运费由店铺承担。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"aftersales-002","question":"签收时发现屏幕有划痕能退吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_returns.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"after_sales","reference":"如果是到货即有的外观问题，按质量问题退货处理，7 天内可申请且运费由店铺承担，需提供开箱照片或视频，客服 1–2 个工作日审核；使用或碰撞造成的划痕不属于质量问题退货范围。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"aftersales-003","question":"拆封了还能无理由退货吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_returns.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"after_sales","reference":"本店未设置无理由退货承诺，不能推断拆封商品都能退；签收之日起 7 天内存在质量问题才可申请退货，已拆封并不单独决定能否退。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"aftersales-004","question":"外观问题要交什么材料？多久审核？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_application.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"after_sales","reference":"需提供开箱照片或视频，客服 1–2 个工作日内审核；还需订单编号、商品名称和问题说明。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"aftersales-005","question":"换货能顺便换成更贵的型号吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_exchange.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"after_sales","reference":"不能。换货是更换为同型号、同规格的可用商品，不是自动升级，店铺也不承诺跨型号补差价换购。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"aftersales-006","question":"退款多久能到账？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_refunds.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"after_sales","reference":"仓库收到退件后一般 2 个工作日内验收；验收通过后店铺 1–3 个工作日内发起原路退款；支付渠道通常再需 1–5 个工作日到账。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"aftersales-007","question":"耳机保修多长时间？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_warranty.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"warranty","reference":"听岚系列耳机与栖光台灯自签收起提供 12 个月有限保修，针对正常使用下确认的非人为功能故障。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"aftersales-008","question":"耳机摔坏了还保修吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_warranty.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"warranty","reference":"跌落撞击造成的损坏不直接纳入免费保修，需要另行核查，客服不能仅凭描述承诺免费维修。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"aftersales-009","question":"我还在保修期里，能直接退货吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"after_sales_warranty.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"warranty","reference":"不能这样理解。保修通常通过检测、维修或更换处理；只有签收 7 天内存在质量问题才符合退货条件。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"payment-001","question":"下单后多久内要付款？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"payment_methods.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"payment","reference":"提交订单后应在 30 分钟内完成支付，超时未支付订单自动关闭。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"payment-002","question":"可以货到付款吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"payment_methods.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"payment","reference":"不支持货到付款；支付渠道以结算页列出的银行卡快捷支付和账户余额支付为准。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"payment-003","question":"好像重复扣款了怎么办？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"payment_methods.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"payment","reference":"先确认订单是否已成功，保存支付流水号；联系客服时提供订单编号、交易时间及遮盖敏感信息的账单截图，不要提供支付密码、验证码或完整银行卡号。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"payment-004","question":"发票怎么开？多久能开出来？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"payment_invoices.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"payment","reference":"订单完成后 30 天内，在订单详情的“申请发票”入口提交，信息完整后一般 3 个工作日内开出，电子文件可在订单页下载。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"payment-005","question":"能开纸质发票吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"payment_invoices.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"payment","reference":"不能承诺。店铺提供与实际支付金额对应的普通电子发票，不提供纸质发票。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"payment-006","question":"发货了还能改收货地址吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"payment_order_changes.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"payment","reference":"不能保证。订单进入仓库拣货前可提交修改；开始拣货或已发出后不保证修改成功，客服只能核实能否拦截。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"payment-007","question":"已经付款的订单还能取消吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"payment_order_changes.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"payment","reference":"尚未进入拣货的已支付订单可申请取消，批准后按原渠道退款；进入拣货或发货阶段需先核实能否拦截，不能承诺立即撤单。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"promotion-001","question":"一张订单能叠加用几张优惠券？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"promotion_coupons.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"promotion","reference":"同一订单最多使用一张店铺优惠券，多张店铺券不能叠加。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"promotion-002","question":"运费算在优惠券门槛里吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"promotion_coupons.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"promotion","reference":"不算。券的门槛按适用商品的优惠前金额判断，运费不参与凑券门槛。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"promotion-003","question":"全额退款以后优惠券会还给我吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"promotion_coupons.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"promotion","reference":"已支付订单全额退款后，尚未过期且支持返还的券一般在退款完成后 1 个工作日内退回；已过期券不自动延期，部分退款不自动返还整张券。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"promotion-004","question":"会员积分什么时候到账？怎么算？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"promotion_membership.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"promotion","reference":"确认收货后的第 8 天发放，按商品实际支付金额每满 1 元计 1 积分，运费不计入，退款商品不累计。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"promotion-005","question":"积分多久过期？能直接抵现金吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"promotion_membership.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"promotion","reference":"积分自到账之日起有效 12 个月；店铺不支持按固定比例直接抵现，可在会员页兑换当时展示的店铺优惠券。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"normal","reviewed":false}
{"id":"promotion-006","question":"你们有价保吗？买完降价能退差价吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"promotion_campaigns.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"promotion","reference":"店铺当前没有统一的全店价保承诺；个别活动如有单独价保规则，需按该活动范围和有效时间核实。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
{"id":"promotion-007","question":"活动价能和优惠券一起用吗？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"promotion_campaigns.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"promotion","reference":"以结算页实际可选的优惠结果为准，不能默认所有活动都支持重复折扣。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true}
