{"id":"catalog-003","question":"商品分类有哪些？","history":[],"expected_route":"answer","expected_doc":"product_catalog.md","answerable":true,"scenario":"colloquial_product_catalog","reference":"分为无线耳机、桌面台灯和保温杯三类，共 4 款商品。","source_version":"kb-baseline-v1","risk":"boundary","reviewed":true,"reference_after_expansion":"目前收录50款商品，分为无线耳机、桌面台灯、保温杯、蓝牙音箱、充电设备、数据线与配件、键盘鼠标、收纳包、香薰加湿九个品类。","source_version_after_expansion":"kb-expanded-v1"}
